;; PICO-8/TIC-80 style. Authored 2026-07-26.
;;
;; Chapters marked :status "planned" are declared here but not yet authored;
;; the cover (chapter 0) is authored. No placeholder files are created for
;; planned chapters (no-fabrication doctrine) — they are written for real,
;; in order, and their :status flips to "authored" as each lands.

